{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1329206-new-canis-minor-adventure-the-cat-will-mew-and-dog-will-have-his-day","id":1329206,"title":"New Canis Minor Adventure- The Cat Will Mew and Dog Will Have His Day","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Realms of Pugmire"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-08-03T18:13:50-07:00","id":1329206,"title":"New Canis Minor Adventure- The Cat Will Mew and Dog Will Have His Day","content":"Figured I would tell people about my Canis Minor submission: <br /> <br /> <br /> The Cat Will Mew And Dog Will Have His Day<br /> Apocalypse Meow Part I<br /> We begin in the Fearless Forest in search of treasures, but fate leads the Trailblazers back into the political intrigues of Castle Korat. Can the Trailblazers intervene to stop the War or Dogs and Cats returning once again to the Monarchies of Mau?<br /> <br /> \u201cThe Cat will Mew and Dog will Have his Day\u201d is the first chapter of the <i>Apocalypse Meow</i> storyline, of which there are intended to be six parts. Chapter one is a starting adventure for new players. The storyline is designed to start with first-level cats and have the characters develop over the course of the storyline.<br /> <br /> In addition to the scenario, this supplement also includes:<br /> - A new Masterwork Item<br /> -Rules for a new Mancer Practice- Pleonexiamancy, the Magic of Territory<br /> - 2 New Secrets and Three New Creatures<br /> <br /> <br /> Requires the Monarchies of Mau Core Rulebook to play.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/284761/The-Cat-Will-Mew-And-Dog-Will-Have-His-Day\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/4261/284761.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/284761/The-Cat-Will-Mew-And-Dog-Will-Have-His-Day\" target=\"_blank\"> The Cat Will Mew And Dog Will Have His Day - Onyx Path Publishing | Canis Minor | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/284761/The-Cat-Will-Mew-And-Dog-Will-Have-His-Day\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/284761/The-Cat-Will-Mew-And-Dog-Will-Have-His-Day </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The Cat Will Mew And Dog Will Have His Day - We begin in the Fearless Forest in search of treasures, but fate leads the Trailblazers back into the political intrigue </div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25352-vigiles","name":"Vigiles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25352_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-04T05:42:22-07:00","id":1329260,"title":"","content":"Sounds very interesting - I would look into it - but this price is very high for fan content. It's even higher than 3 official adventures of the Onyx Path Studio - official <i><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/273857/Adventures-for-Curious-Cats?cPath=8329_23127\" target=\"_blank\">Adventures for Curious Cats</a> </i>is just for under 5$ - <i>especially</i> as it's 1 of 6 parts chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-